======================================================================

The worksheet MUST satisfy ALL of the following requirements.

• Fit on exactly ONE page.
• Be a complete LaTeX document that compiles without modification.
• Follow the formatting of the provided gold standard worksheet exactly.
• Include the same LaTeX preamble.
• Follow the same document structure.
